{"strongs": "H6780", "word": "צֶ֫מַח", "translit": "tse.mach", "root": "צמח", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "sprout, growth", "definition": "צֶ֫מַח noun masculine Jer 23:5 sprout, growth ; — absolute ׳ צ Hos 8:7 +, צֶ֑מַח Zech 3:8 construct צֶ֫מַח Gen 19:25 +; suffix צִמְחָהּ Ezek 17:9 +; — 1. collective sprouting, growth , הָאֲדָמָה ׳ צ Gen 19:25 ( J ), הַשָּׂדֶה ׳ צ Ezek 16:7 (simile), compare Isa 61:11 ; Ps 65:11 so יהוה ׳ צ Isa 4:2 , ׳ צ absolute Hos 8:7 growth (= foliage) of vine, ׳ טַרְפֵּי צ Ezek 17:9 . 2. process of growth , of vine, עֲרֻגֹת צִמְתָהּ Ezek 17:10 = the beds where it grew. 3. future ruler, under figure of sprout from Davidic tree (compare Ps 132:17 ) וַהֲקִמֹתִי צַדִּיק ׳ לְדָוִר צ Jer 23:5 a righteous sprout, shoot , = צְדָקָה ׳ אַצְמִיחַ לְדָוִד צ Jer 33:15 hence (as proper name) ׳ עַבְדִּי צ Zech 3:8 , of Zerubbabel שְׁמוֺ ׳ אִישׁ צ Zech 6:12 . צַמִּים see צמם . צְמִיתֻת see צמת . below,", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7112')\">BDB7112</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6780')\">H6780</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7111')\">BDB7111</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7113')\">BDB7113</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>צֶ֫מַח</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Jer 23:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,5)\">Jer 23:5</ref></sup> <highlightword>sprout, growth</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 8:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,7)\">Hos 8:7</ref> +, <bdbheb>צֶ֑מַח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 3:8\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(38,3,8)\">Zech 3:8</ref> construct <bdbheb>צֶ֫מַח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,25)\">Gen 19:25</ref>+; suffix <bdbheb>צִמְחָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,9)\">Ezek 17:9</ref> +; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> collective <highlight>sprouting, growth</highlight>, <bdbheb>הָאֲדָמָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,25)\">Gen 19:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>הַשָּׂדֶה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,7)\">Ezek 16:7</ref> (simile), compare <ref ref=\"Isa 61:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,11)\">Isa 61:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 65:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,65,11)\">Ps 65:11</ref> so <bdbheb>יהוה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 4:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,2)\">Isa 4:2</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Hos 8:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,7)\">Hos 8:7</ref> <highlight>growth</highlight> (= foliage) of vine, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>טַרְפֵּי צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,9)\">Ezek 17:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> process of <highlight>growth</highlight>, of vine, <bdbheb>עֲרֻגֹת צִמְתָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,10)\">Ezek 17:10</ref> = <highlight>the beds where it grew.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> future ruler, under figure of <highlight>sprout</highlight> from Davidic tree (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 132:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,17)\">Ps 132:17</ref>) <bdbheb>וַהֲקִמֹתִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>צַדִּיק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְדָוִר צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,5)\">Jer 23:5</ref> <highlight>a righteous sprout, shoot</highlight>, = <bdbheb>צְדָקָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַצְמִיחַ לְדָוִד צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,15)\">Jer 33:15</ref> hence (as proper name) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַבְדִּי צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 3:8\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(38,3,8)\">Zech 3:8</ref>, of Zerubbabel <bdbheb>שְׁמוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִישׁ צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 6:12\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(38,6,12)\">Zech 6:12</ref>. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>צַמִּים</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>צמם</reflink></bdbheb>. <bdbheb>צְמִיתֻת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>צמת</reflink></bdbheb>. below, </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Jer 23:5", "book": "JER", "chapter": 23, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Hos 8:7", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 8, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Zech 3:8", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 3, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Gen 19:25", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 19, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ezek 17:9", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 17, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 16:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 16, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 61:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 61, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 65:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 65, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 4:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 4, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 17:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 17, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ps 132:17", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 132, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Jer 33:15", "book": "JER", "chapter": 33, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Zech 6:12", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 6, "verse": 12}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["צֶ֫מַח", "׳", "צ", "צֶ֑מַח", "צִמְחָהּ", "הָאֲדָמָה", "הַשָּׂדֶה", "יהוה", "טַרְפֵּ